sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Manage account and settings
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 44
    %% Description: A customer creates an account, manages newsletter and push notifications, links a loyalty card and adjusts the display settings.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant CU as Customer
    participant NL as Newsletter
    participant LC as LoyaltyCard

    %% covers 1
    CP->>CU: create account
    %% covers 2, 3
    CP->>CU: subscribe to or unsubscribe from the newsletter
    CU->>NL: newsletter subscription
    %% covers 4, 5
    CP->>CU: switch push notifications on or off
    %% covers 44
    CP->>CU: link loyalty card
    CU->>LC: loyalty card
    %% covers 7, 8, 9
    CP->>CU: change display and language settings
    %% covers 6
    CP->>CU: reset password
